    "notes": "The selected text is the standalone 31-word Ave Regina Caelorum under no. 324 in the 1952 Enchiridion indulgentiarum. Key of Heaven 1901 confirms every substantive word. Lasance 1906 differs substantively at w023, where it prints Valde in place of Vale; the controlling reading Vale is retained and recorded. Seasonal rubrics, the following versicle, response, Oremus and collect, indulgence matter and neighboring Marian antiphons are distinct units and are excluded. The controlling eight-line structure is retained.",
